# Familiar's conversation model.
#
# Load-time parameters only. Sampling (temperature, top_p, seed) and `think` are per-request and
# cost nothing to vary, so they stay in the caller. num_ctx cannot: a request asking for a different
# window reloads the model and drops its KV cache. Baking it here means a caller that forgets to
# send it gets the right window rather than Ollama's 4096 default - which truncates silently, so
# the symptom is a model that "forgets" its persona, not an error.
#
# The base is the Phase 0 bake-off winner (README.md, 2026-10-01): the only candidate with perfect
# tool calls, no tool leakage into speech, and emotion tags that fit the conversation.
# create-models.sh can still override it (BASE=...) to try another base under the same name.
#
# gemma4 is a thinking model. Callers send `think: false`: reasoning before every spoken reply
# costs seconds a voice turn doesn't have. That is per-request, so it isn't set here.

FROM gemma4:12b

# 8k, from the budget (PLAN.md §4.3):
#
#   system + tool definitions   ~2,000
#   persona                       ~400
#   memories                      ~500
#   situation block               ~300
#   summary + recent turns      ~3,000
#   generation                    ~600   a spoken reply is a few sentences
#   headroom                    ~1,400
#
# Re-measure with real prompt_eval_count figures once phase 1 exists; change it here with the reason.
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192

# A conversational default. The caller lowers it for anything that must satisfy a schema.
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
